# Lakeside Minuet (jeuno 95) at level 30 with ENABLE_WOTG true: the Lua's `true == 1` is false (Settings.MainEquals, quest
# rework P9; MainNumber / Main would read true as 1): no section; Laila's default 10120. Then 1: 10111. Recorded on Lua at
# 18acd18b^ (the parent of the commit that deleted the Lua).
lists UpperJeuno/Laila/onTrigger
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-52.5,0,101 job=WAR lvl=30
setting ENABLE_WOTG true
login
trigger Laila                           # true is not 1: no section; default 10120
finish
setting ENABLE_WOTG 1
trigger Laila                           # WotG on, level 30: 10111
finish                                  # option 0: not begun
